---
import InnerPage from '../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Pricing"
	description="TeleTrex pricing: simple packages for startups and SMBs, plus custom scopes when you need them."
>
	<h1>Pricing</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		Most teams want a clear starting point—not a 40-line enterprise matrix. Here’s how we usually work
		together; exact numbers depend on volume, channels, and how custom you need the setup to be.
	</p>

	<div class="tiers">
		<article class="tier">
			<h2 class="tier__name">Starter</h2>
			<p class="tier__for">For proving value fast</p>
			<p class="tier__body">
				One primary use case (for example: website Q&amp;A or email triage), a focused knowledge base,
				and launch support so your team isn’t on their own day one.
			</p>
		</article>
		<article class="tier tier--featured">
			<h2 class="tier__name">Growth</h2>
			<p class="tier__for">For teams feeling the inbox pressure</p>
			<p class="tier__body">
				Multiple touchpoints, richer workflows, and tighter guardrails. Typical when Relay is handling a
				real slice of volume and you need reliability plus room to iterate.
			</p>
		</article>
		<article class="tier">
			<h2 class="tier__name">Partner</h2>
			<p class="tier__for">For custom or multi-location needs</p>
			<p class="tier__body">
				Integrations, advanced routing, or ongoing optimization. We’ll scope this together after we
				understand your stack and goals—no surprises.
			</p>
		</article>
	</div>

	<p class="prose-block prose-block--spaced">
		<strong>Ballpark:</strong> Most Starter and Growth engagements land in a straightforward monthly or
		project range—we’ll quote after a short call. If we’re not the right fit, we’ll say so.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		<a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call for a quote</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.tiers {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 700px) {
		.tiers {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 1.25rem;
			align-items: stretch;
		}
	}

	.tier {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
	}

	.tier--featured {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.15);
	}

	.tier__name {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.tier__for {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.tier__body {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.prose-block--spaced {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
</style>
